+/*
+================
+IN_VKQIgnoreSpatial -- vkquake-ios overlay 0019 (charter A10, trap ledger)
+
+visionOS 26 vends each PSVR2 Sense half as its own GCController once the app
+declares `SpatialGamepad`. SDL3's MFi backend adopts ANY GCController with a
+physical input profile (SDL_mfijoystick.m's generic branch), so without this the
+pair arrives as two half-gamepads, SDL opens the FIRST one it sees, and the
+player gets movement from one fist and nothing from the other.
